        "transliteration": "inna bayni wa bayna allahi `azza wa jalla dhunuban la ya'ti `alayha illa ridakum fabihaqqi man i'tamanakum `ala sirrihi wastar`akum amra khalqihi wa qarana ta`atakum bita`atihi lamma istawhabtum dhunubi wa kuntum shufa`a'i fa'inni lakum muti`un man ata`akum faqd ata`a allaha wa man `asakum faqad `asa allaha wa man ahabbakum faqad ahabba allaha wa man abghadakum faqad abghada allaha allahumma inni law wajadtu shufa`a'a",
